{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big/core：Y 的大块能直接串出靠近、克制、被接纳、担心失去、重新接纳自己的完整情绪变化；X 只放大零散词组，单看大字较难明白每屏的主要处境和前后关系。small/fine：Y 的感受更多落在观众的身体和关系体验上，如耳语般的亲近、独处时泛酸、喉咙发紧，具体且有辨识度；X 有较多左手、右手、颤音、琶音等音乐描写，对观众自身体验的补充相对少。human/load：X 的语言衔接更自然，Y 有“船板晃得一下失重”“动作先露出了害怕”“念头刚安静又冒出算了但还是放不下”等具体搭配和语序问题；load 则 X 的放大词组较短，Y 每屏有多块较长的大字，尤其 S11、S14，扫读负担更大；concise 两版都有局部复述和冗余，整体差距不够明显，判平。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "526e5e87-943d-45d5-bef1-7b2aae646673", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T212124447498Z", "elapsed_seconds": 233.657, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T21:25:18.123476+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0a85f9ae7d3713110c66140d7073b00ce8629efa22fde74adc604423226c9897", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\